ートする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9407","sourceWorkId":"16236","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編のメインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時間の止まった北欧神話世界で記憶体の管理を自らの役目としていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラグナロクに際して何一つ出来ずじまいの上、次の世界も始まらないため、自分を役立たずだと決めつけていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時が止まった世界では、自分の存在さえもわからない状態だったからだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、ノルンたちの戦闘に巻き込まれた桃矢と出会い、窮地を救われて一目惚れ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼を護るため “ソル” の記憶体を吸収し、戦乙女へと変身する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今はただひたすら、マスターである桃矢の側近くに侍り、彼の思いに従うことだけが自分の勤めであり、望みになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「他の世界の、戦乙女と戦うことになるんですよね……きっと。私、ちゃんと勝てるでしょうか……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53281"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53281","value":"時の記憶庫（北欧神話世界）"},{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53281","value":"マスター♪"},{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53281","value":"桃矢に対しては従順、一途。それ以外の人には、少し……かなり腹黒い"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53281","value":"記憶体（メモリー）の再生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9407","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9407","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9407","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9407","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6d01576b9abfec0f0bf9b50526596b363ae1b4222e3a70dc16149a00104c32e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02a02bd936eabf43515d1b095767a528afa96d3f3376da46d7e41027d3c0de4d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25542:53281:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c45045","characterName":"パルフィナ・アレキサンドリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25542"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9408"],"vndbCharacterId":"c45045"},"originalCharacterName":"パルフィナ・アレキサンドリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風と知識の都・アレクサンドリア出身の上位魔法戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女は世界同士が繋がった原因を調査するため中央世界へと渡る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところが、調査しようにもなかなか進まず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらには異世界からの干渉が増えつつある中央世界では異形によるトラブルが頻発。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気がつけば平和を守る魔法少女（自称）として活躍することに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9408","sourceWorkId":"16236","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風と知識の都・アレクサンドリア出身の上位魔法戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の生まれた世界には “魔法” という力が当たり前に存在し、他にも 『水の都・ヴァンチェスタ』 など、有名な魔法都市・魔法学院が存在する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パルフィナは戦いと知恵の女神・アテーナのピュティア（巫女）の家系に生まれ、秘術に属する魔法や、天位と称される槍術をも体得する優秀な戦士である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし生まれてからずっと女系家族で、学校も女子高だったため、やや男性恐怖症気味であることが彼女の最大の弱点となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わ、私は！　め、女神の祝福を受け、魔術、槍術、共に人後に落ちませんっ！　だ、だから！ と、殿方は密着とかしないでくださいっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53282"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53282","value":"天空と知識の都・アレクサンドリア（ギリシャ神話世界）"},{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53282","value":"好き嫌いをするほど子供じゃありません。"},{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53282","value":"生真面目で、やや堅苦しいほど。困っている人を放っておけない優しさも"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53282","value":"アテナイ流"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9408","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9408","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9408","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9408","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25ccbf75a832c4c50f6f6581f38f25a4196baf10ed313186f17ec6bd3a71d940.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/478e6c9e553e60c4e1307e6d5bc96fbc6560ab5675abb09e6df4c1134a7ec0ce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25542:53282:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c45046","characterName":"レギンレイヴ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53287","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25542"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9412"],"vndbCharacterId":"c45046"},"originalCharacterName":"レギンレイヴ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","statu