は戦乙女と同等と言って良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、同じポーンタイプのフェアリーピースには、赤い鎧の “ルージュ”、黒い鎧の “ノワール” もいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は、私が大切だって思う人が笑顔でいてくれるように頑張るんです！　それに、誰かを泣かせて平気でいられる人が、正しいわけがないのです！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53285"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53285","value":"ドクターのラボ（白の星）"},{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53285","value":"美味しいご飯と、それを食べる人の幸せな顔なのです！"},{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53285","value":"平和主義者で素直な良い子。同時に正義感も強く、努力家でもある"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53285","value":"家電。ゴハンが炊けます"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9410","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9410","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9410","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9410","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3f4f06a92ed7bd17e094559729cac0c5384e79228c467a0376299af6a4cea9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/825d2ed66e09ecb5890cf13869f086e1e73d4afb6050552f2a0f9de272b83681.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"由倉奈於","creatorId":"vndb:s923","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s923","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s923","name":"由倉 奈於","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25542:53285:6083:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c45049","characterName":"夜鳥姫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53284","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25542"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9409"],"vndbCharacterId":"c45049"},"originalCharacterName":"夜鳥姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あやかしの世界で生まれたものたちは、肉体が死んでも魂が朽ちぬ限り戦うことが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その力は強大で異世界では鬼、妖怪、悪魔などと呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その、あやかし達が住む世界の王である四神の一つ朱雀の姫巫女として生まれた夜鳥姫は、それにふさわしい戦闘能力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、桃矢の中にあやかしの血を感じた彼女は、“人型の同族”として彼を婿に選ぶのだが……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9409","sourceWorkId":"16236","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あやかしの世界で生まれたものは、肉体が滅んでも魂が朽ちぬ限り、無限の寿命を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼らは果てなき闘争心を満たすため、自然をも操る妖術を使いこなし、異世界へさえも侵入する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その、あやかし世界の王である四神の一つ、朱雀の姫巫女として生まれた夜鳥姫は、それにふさわしい戦闘能力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の愛刀・炎鉄鬼哭（えんてつきこく）は、魂を弾丸に換えた魂魄弾によりあやかしたちを両断し、その魂すら焼き尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「滅びる覚悟の出来た者から、前へ出ろ……　我が愛刀・炎鉄鬼哭によって、魂ごと烈火と咲かせてくれる！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53284"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53284","value":"王母桃の麓（あやかしの世界）"},{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53284","value":"子作りも大事だが、“男”というものを味わってみたくて仕方ない♪"},{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53284","value":"姉御肌で喧嘩好き。真っ正直で、相手が正しいと感じれば素直に認める"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53284","value":"四天流剣術"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9409","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9409","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9409","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9409","sourceWorkId":"16236","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6d9cea18c1aeebff243a11f6ab051e9975b8a086ec8b3dc42259924254d4a7e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12f0c28bf7a3413bd8fd01f024e3c144a8d6682ad85790aaa4b68e5d664f1d6f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25542:53284:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55461","characterName":"硲 桃矢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["9414"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55461"},"originalCharacterName":"硲 桃矢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編の主人公。巨大な剣が突き刺さった中央世界の日本・東京で暮らすフリーターの青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼の一族は、かつてはこの世に現れる異形、物の怪を狩る役目を担っていた者達であり、太古にはその物の怪と交わったという伝説もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためか彼の右腕には、あやかしの力が宿っており、全てを断ち、喰らい、空間さえ穿つ力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在の桃矢は里を離れ、無職のフリーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２４時間営業のコンビニで、ほぼ２４時間働かさ